sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant SK as SvelteKit server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    User->>SK: Change ticket status
    SK->>SK: Authorize actor, ticket and transition
    SK->>DB: Begin transaction
    SK->>DB: Update ticket status + updated_at
    SK->>DB: Insert event with old/new status
    alt Both operations succeed
        SK->>DB: Commit
        SK-->>User: Show updated ticket
    else Either operation fails
        SK->>DB: Roll back
        SK-->>User: Show error, no partial change
    end
